---
name: Honey Deuce
ingredients:
  - type: Vodka
    amount: '1.5'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemonade
    amount: '3'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Raspberry liqueur
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Honeydew melon balls
    amount: '3'
    unit: count
    garnish: true
category:
  - vodka
image: ../../images/cocktails/honey-deuce/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.wineenthusiast.com/recipe/honey-deuce-cocktail/
---
1. Scoop honeydew melon balls using a melon baller and freeze.
1. Chill a highball glass in the fridge or freezer before serving.
1. Fill the glass with cubed ice and add vodka.
1. Top with lemonade and raspberry liqueur.
1. Garnish with a skewer of three frozen honeydew melon balls.
